Capgemini AWS DevOps Interview – All Questions

1. Can you introduce yourself and explain your day-to-day activities in your current role?

2. Are you comfortable writing a CI/CD pipeline from scratch using Jenkins or GitHub Actions?

3. What are the stages and commands you would include in a basic CI/CD pipeline?

4. Why do we pass the ECR registry parameter in the Docker build or login command?

5. Is docker.build a function or a command?

6. What parameters do you pass to the docker build command?

7. What exactly are you doing in the docker.withRegistry command where you pass your ECR registry?

8. Are authentication and pushing to the registry happening in the same command?

9. What happens after the Docker image is pushed to the ECR registry in your pipeline?

10. How do you create the infrastructure for Amazon ECS?

11. Did you create the infrastructure yourself, or was it already there and you were just using it?

12. Have you created Terraform modules yourself?

13. What parameters did you add to the Terraform module you created?

14. What happens if two team members run the same Terraform script at the same time? Will it create duplicate resources?

15. How do you troubleshoot an ECS deployment failure due to a CrashLoop error?

16. What is a CrashLoopBackOff error in Kubernetes or ECS?

17. What are the common causes of a CrashLoopBackOff error?

18. What specific Kubernetes commands do you use to troubleshoot a CrashLoopBackOff error?

19. What are the different launch types available in Amazon ECS from an infrastructure point of view?

20. When should you choose EC2 launch type versus Fargate in Amazon ECS? In which scenarios would you select each?

21. Suppose after deployment you observe latency issues. How do you identify exactly where the bottleneck is?

22. Have you worked on AWS Lambda? What was the use case?

23. Which commands or API calls did you use in your script to take backups?

24. Did you write the backup automation script yourself, or was it written by someone else?

25. Have you architected a two-tier application? How would you make it secure and highly scalable?

26. How can you ensure data is secure in transit in your application architecture?

27. Do you have any questions for me?
